  "scope": "A payout was recorded, queued and then blocked because no payment authority existed. Adds the live Remesso adapter and, more importantly, an account of what a payment authority can actually deliver: one token approval is shared by every policy the same wallet grants, so per-campaign budgets say nothing about solvency and two live briefs could each believe they were funded",
